es made with Godot roughly doubled between 2023 and 2024, largely at Unity's expense following Unity's controversial runtime fee announcement. On Steam in 2026, Unity leads with ~206 new titles, Unreal has ~107, Godot ~60, and Game Maker is declining. Unreal dominates in AAA revenue, Unity still owns mobile, and Godot is gaining ground primarily from Unity and Game Maker's user bases.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VmUiR4dW8zw/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-07T15:09:58.000Z"},{"id":"qYzuOceEb","title":"Free game dev assets roundup for May 2026","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FAApDnEI2mM","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/free-gamedev-assets---may-2026-roundup-3dgamedevelopment-unity3d-unrealengine-godot-qyzuoceeb","summary":"A roundup of free game development assets available in May 2026. Highlights include three free assets from Epic Games on the Fab Marketplace (a low-polygon factory environment, a lens flare VFX pack for Unreal Engine, and a steampunk creature), available free until May 19th. Also covered: Kenny's updated input prompts pack (now with Steam controller and Oculus Quest icons), UModeler X for Unity (now free, enabling modeling, painting, texturing, and rigging inside Unity without sign-up), and new download options on Super Splat.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FAApDnEI2mM/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-05T14:18:38.000Z"},{"id":"lYoPAqrmm","title":"Anthropic x Blender: The Fallout!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_suBlGBTlpQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/anthropic-x-blender-the-fallout--lyopaqrmm","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_suBlGBTlpQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T18:28:06.000Z"},{"id":"tYGULqW2c","title":"Are Gaussian Splats the Future of Level Design?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uQ1O5UCASxE","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/are-gaussian-splats-the-future-of-level-design--tygulqw2c","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uQ1O5UCASxE/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T14:02:43.000Z"},{"id":"0gBoygBEv","title":"Troubles in the S&Box?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=39scULDvYjM","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/troubles-in-the-s-box--0gboygbev","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/39scULDvYjM/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T16:38:58.000Z"},{"id":"xfDkkJ4HQ","title":"TypeScript, C#, 3D & More: GameMaker in 2026","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Czr8KXRG9g","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/typescript-c-3d-more-gamemaker-in-2026-xfdkkj4hq","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4Czr8KXRG9g/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:23:21.000Z"},{"id":"xoHYESkDf","title":"Anthropic x Blender?!?!?!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zi0A7YJojNY","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/anthropic-x-blender--xohyeskdf","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zi0A7YJojNY/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-28T16:24:35.000Z"},{"id":"Pze2LH0Ie","title":"S&Box - Killer Game Engine or Just a Toy?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ju_rvxhhq7M","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/s-box---killer-game-engine-or-just-a-toy--pze2lh0ie","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ju_rvxhhq7M/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-28T15:40:04.000Z"},{"id":"reQhRnY3J","title":"Godot 4.7 Beta is Here!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06aEcajkWQo","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/godot-4-7-beta-is-here--reqhrny3j","summary":"Godot 4.7 has reached beta, freezing all new features. Key highlights include the new AreaLight3D node that supports rectangular light sources with image texture projection, HDR support on Windows/macOS/Linux (Wayland), drawable textures, bilinear filtering for retro-style games, a built-in shader previewer (previously an add-on), copy-paste for entire property groups in the inspector, vertex snapping in the editor, path snapping to collision surfaces, a 2D scene paint tool, virtual joystick controls out of the box, one-way collision improvements, animation group collapsing, asset library version history, and various editor quality-of-life improvements.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/06aEcajkWQo/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-27T15:43:58.000Z"},{"id":"ujnEajR1X","title":"Real HDR Arrives in Godot 4.7!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3yb4OTFYJRQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/real-hdr-arrives-in-godot-4-7--ujneajr1x","summary":"Godot 4.7 is adding HDR output support across all major platforms. Windows support arrived in dev 1, Apple devices in dev 2, and Linux/BSD in dev 3. Key requirements include using the Forward+ or Mobile renderer, Direct3D12 on Windows, Vulkan on Linux/macOS, and Wayland (not X11) on Linux. Android support is still in progress. To enable HDR in a project, go to Project Settings > Display > Window and toggle 'Request HDR Output'. HDR also only works with filmic and ACES tone mapping modes. A demo project and official documentation are available to help developers test and author HDR content.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3yb4OTFYJRQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-25T15:32:05.000Z"}],"top_posts":[{"id":"6SmYtESva","title":"Zed code editor launches on Windows with performance focus","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2e7SkqzBAYk","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/zed---the-visual-studio-code-killer---now-on-windows--6smytesva","summary":"Zed, a performance-focused code editor built in Rust, is now available on Windows after being Mac and Linux exclusive. The editor emphasizes speed through GPU acceleration and multi-core CPU usage, featuring instant startup times and responsive UI. It includes AI integration with support for multiple providers (Gemini, Copilot), built-in debugging, git integration, real-time collaboration, and an extension system. While the Windows port is functional, some features like language servers may require additional setup compared to the more mature Mac and Linux versions.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2e7SkqzBAYk/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":122,"num_comments":29,"created_at":"2025-10-24T15:03:30.000Z"},{"id":"K6JcL0ycA","title":"Complete guide to code editors and IDEs for developers in 2025","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rEZJWk-rjcQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-best-code-editors-ides-in-2025-k6jcl0yca","summary":"A comprehensive overview of 40+ programming tools across four categories: terminal-based editors (Emacs, Vim, Neovim, Helix), full IDEs (Visual Studio, Xcode, JetBrains suite, Eclipse), powerful text editors (Notepad++, Sublime Text, UltraEdit), and modern hybrid editors (Visual Studio Code and its many forks including Cursor, Windsurf, Zed). The guide covers both free and commercial options, highlighting their strengths, target audiences, and current development status as of 2025.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rEZJWk-rjcQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":121,"num_comments":9,"created_at":"2025-05-29T16:15:55.000Z"},{"id":"CLY3TCnPM","title":"Godot's Popularity Explosion!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-sNLnzw7EgI","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/godot-s-popularity-explosion--cly3tcnpm","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-sNLnzw7EgI/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":97,"num_comments":4,"created_at":"2024-08-22T15:35:16.000Z"},{"id":"pp3qGgBJB","title":"Quixel Megascans to be 100% FREE FOR EVERYONE UNTIL END OF 2024!!! ...Then Free For Nobody.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rnrHEY-qO-c","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/quixel-megascans-to-be-100-free-for-everyone-until-end-of-2024-then-free-for-nobody--pp3qggbjb","summary":"Quixel Megascans will be free for everyone until the end of 2024 when accessed through the new Epic Games marketplace, Fab. This includes textures, 3D objects, and more, available for all game engines, not just Unreal Engine. From 2025, Quixel Megascans will no longer be free, so users are encouraged to acquire assets before the deadline to retain perpetual usage rights.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rnrHEY-qO-c/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":43,"num_comments":11,"created_at":"2024-09-17T13:22:41.000Z"},{"id":"jpBbT2sKd","title":"Godot 4.4 introduces jiggle physics and other new features","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ClRH5HruUEQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/godot-gets-jiggle-physics-jpbbt2skd","summary":"Godot 4.4 introduces many new features, including jiggle physics, which can be easily implemented using the Spring Bone Simulator 3D. The update also includes improvements in embedded game windows, shader functionalities, and additional animation modifiers. This release is considered by some as the best version of Godot yet due to the numerous quality-of-life enhancements.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ClRH5HruUEQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":62,"num_comments":5,"created_at":"2025-03-10T15:13:49.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["davegray","twoninutepapers","typecraft","bycloud","lowlevellearning"],"opposite_handles":["alexfinn","tbpn","kloss_xyz","ryolu_","patrickc"],"similar":[{"id":"davegray","handle":"davegray","name":"Dave Gray","is_squad":false,"x":-8.7699,"y":-7.7561,"cluster_id":1,"posts_collected":84,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--q9DAw_zl--/f_auto/v1724390746/logos/davegray","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":1.123502,"median_upvotes":1.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.059524,"avg_read_time":26.821429,"tag_diversity":0.654762},"top_tags_preview":[["webdev",62],["nextjs",34],["javascript",25]]